[20.830536, "o", "   - Extract and format '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[20.83057, "o", "   - Extract the count of roles as '\"'\"'role_count'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[20.830608, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[20.830741, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[20.83077, "o", "> "]
[20.830899, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[20.830932, "o", "> "]
